  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Hoshiguma?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "You don't look so good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "I'm fine, I was just thinking."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "...I didn't think he'd get dragged into this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Don't worry, you know how I am. It's all in the past now, or as we say in Lungmen, such is fate."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Do people in the Far East believe in fate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Having been through so many things, even if I didn't believe it before, I have to accept it now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Is the intel accurate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Without a doubt. Here's the location indicated by the intel."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Those Reunion members skulking around... are they our targets?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "By the looks of things, they don't know that we've completely surrounded them yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "They seem to be building something around the entire block."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "If I'm not mistaken, this is one of the central hubs that connects Reunion's various bases."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "If we destroy the communication facility here, we can deliver a crippling blow to their forces in this area."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "That would put us one step closer to recapturing the L.G.D. Headquarters."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Your call."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Also, I can't stop thinking about the details of the intel report."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "You mean, that part about Reunion's objective not just being the construction of a forward base?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "'Enemies are secretly looking for an extremely high-value target. It is necessary to determine their actions first.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "What are they doing in the wealthy districts? What kind of high-value target are they trying to find there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "It seems a bit fishy to me as well. According to our previous plans, all the buildings here should already have been evacuated."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "If Reunion is planning to kidnap one of the moguls, they probably won't find them here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "When are we going to make our move? Scouting doesn't seem to be Reunion's strong suit, so we can carry out our raid at any time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "They're probably used to always being the hunters, not the prey."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Now that it's their turn to be the prey, they'll be hunted down in no time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Let's continue observing them carefully for now. Our priority is to find out what their objectives are, not to engage them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "It's easy enough to go in and destroy them, but it'll take patience to find out what they're after."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Wait! Ch'en, are they about to break the door of that house down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Has the target already been confirmed? Assemble, quickly!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "To minimize the loss of civilians, huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Of course! Snipers, take aim!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's Lungmen's army! Fall back!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We need to contact..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Snipers! Shoot down that person with the radio equipment! Stop that transmission!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "They're supposed to be defending the base, so how come they're running away from us? They're up to something!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Let's see how far you can run!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
